# --- Project: generated locally, deliberately not published ---------------
# `docs/` holds the findings report, the technical dossier, figures, tables and
# results.json. It is regenerated by `python -m src.run_all` plus
# `python tools/build_dossier.py`, and is kept off GitHub on purpose -- the
# dossier is private working material. README.md carries the findings instead.
docs/

# The dossier generators embed that same private text verbatim --
# dossier_content.py holds all 19 decision records and 40 interview answers --
# so publishing them would publish the dossier as source code.
tools/build_dossier.py
tools/dossier_build.py
tools/dossier_content.py

# --- Project: regenerable artefacts --------------------------------------
# Rebuild with `python -m src.run_all`.
data/processed/
outputs/segmentation_model.joblib

# Committed on purpose, listed here so the intent is explicit:
#   data/raw/        561 KB, and the pipeline is not reproducible without it
#   data/raw/DATA_SOURCE.md               provenance for the data that ships here
#   outputs/segmented_new_customers.csv   the deliverable itself
